WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:11.980
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.840
On the land with the frozen moonlight

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.670
It's rolling and drawing the line

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:40.880
The era of destruction and rebirth now begins

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.550
Heavily holding the freedom

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:48.120
Choosing the invisible path

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:55.230
Passing the sunset that's brighter than the daylight

00:00:55.230 --> 00:01:02.230
The vessel of time moves on as if telling the dream

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:11.340
There's a new dawn beyond the dark path

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:19.250
We may have been born from the arm of darkness

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:22.790
Just like being in an impossible love

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.760
We wander into the light

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:32.000
The path stretches indefinitely

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:37.490
And there's no way to go back

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:08.200
Enomoto-sama!

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:09.260
That's Enomoto-sama!

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:11.500
Enomoto!

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:15.240
He's finally shown up.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.770
He can't set a good example by being weak.

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:21.400
Come on, this is just for show.

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:22.740
Indeed.

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:32.520
Enomoto-sama!

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:00.080
It's the enemy! The enemy's attacking!

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:05.520
Oh, I knew that was coming.

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:07.520
What happened?

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:11.120
Don't worry. It's just a rat.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.000
Where are they attacking us from?

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.490
Get the injured out of here!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.200
Don't panic! Just put the fire out!

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:24.800
What...

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:27.380
Who are you?

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:28.310
Over here!

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.680
Let's get right to it.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:54.400
Let me handle this.

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:25.400
The enemy!

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:27.410
There's the enemy!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.030
Protect Enomoto!

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:44.790
Kanna?!

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:48.890
Now is the chance.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:50.420
Rook!

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:51.750
Okay!

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:03.780
Damn it!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.000
Cease fire!

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:23.850
It's over.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.690
<i>TOSHIZO</i>
<i>HIJIKATA</i>

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:39.440
It is the 15th day of the ninth month
in the first year of the Meiji Era.

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:43.460
Sendai Province surrenders
to the New Government Army.

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:50.850
Aizu and Shonai soon follow,
and the Ou Alliance collapses.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:59.450
There were very few places left for the Shogunate
Remnants Army in the northeast region, however...

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:11.400
Hijikata, I've been waiting for this moment.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.130
As have I, Enomoto.

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:17.540
Let me show him around the ship.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:22.810
Hijikata, make yourself at home.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:30.680
Do you like this ship?

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:32.110
Yeah...

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:39.490
Now that Sendai has surrendered, the
Satsuma-Choshu forces will come for sure.

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:43.230
Sooner or later the battle
will take us to a new place.

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:45.170
Where would that be?

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:48.940
Inside the head of my comrade Enomoto.

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:52.900
The question is what's inside his gut.

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:54.780
Explain.

00:07:55.510 --> 00:08:01.980
Without understanding what's inside the master's
gut, a samurai can't stake his life for him.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:38.690
Akizuki-sama, there's something
I want to talk to you about.

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:54.870
Akizuki-sama.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:58.140
I'm coming with you.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:06.750
Your destiny is also my destiny.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.690
Draw your sword.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:27.530
Akizuki-sama...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.490
You've gotten much faster.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:03.260
I won't make the same mistake twice.

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:06.930
We're not dealing with paper targets here.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.630
You do understand that, don't you?

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:17.680
I do...

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:19.850
Rook...

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:33.100
Henceforth, we go to defeat Takeaki Enomoto,
no, the Head of the Conqueror,

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:35.360
which is a threat to the British Empire.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:41.700
Our lives belong to Her Majesty.
God save the Queen!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.970
God save the Queen!

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:55.150
So you're still going, huh?

00:11:55.850 --> 00:12:00.760
Be careful on the way there.
Give my best to Shoten.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.490
I'm sorry!

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:05.200
Thank you for waiting.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:08.970
What's going on with your getup?

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:13.700
This works better for me.
I'm used to dressing like a man anyway.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.170
Those two...

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:42.190
It's thanks to you, Hijikata, for expressing your
willingness to fight alongside with us.

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:47.170
Those ambitious soldiers from the many
provinces have decided to follow you.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:53.540
With this many soldiers and this fleet,
we can keep fighting forever.

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:56.440
Those are very encouraging words.

00:12:56.850 --> 00:13:00.550
The rest is up to what's inside
the gut of the master...

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.900
I'm beginning to see a lot of newcomers.

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:18.960
Supposedly many of them are Hijikata's men.

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:22.340
Hijikata? You mean the one from Shinsengumi?

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:23.140
Yeah.

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:46.020
Akizuki?

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.280
A Union Jack!

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:18.020
Course: Enomoto's ship!

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:19.290
Okay!

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:26.900
That ship is charging at us!

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:28.000
Get out of here!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.310
Don't panic!

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:42.110
No one can challenge my invincible fleet!

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:47.320
You must trust me! Put your trust in
Takeaki Enomoto!

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:51.220
Men, you must follow me!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.960
Prepare to fire!

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:57.060
Yes, sir!

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:02.300
Prepare to fire!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:03.600
Preparing to fire!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:08.010
Target: the British ship off starboard!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:08.880
Fire!

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:19.350
They're coming!

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:33.130
Don't be intimidated! Keep going!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.320
Don't be scared! We have ten men
to their one! Surround them!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:55.620
Kill all our enemies, the British soldiers!
Draw your swords!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:05.300
What is this?

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:08.060
None of them are afraid to die!

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:12.400
No, they could be driven by something
much more fearsome than death...

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.510
This is it!

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:23.610
I won't let you humiliate me twice!

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:26.590
Shit!

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:38.930
Rook!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.430
Don't!

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:43.010
This atmosphere is no joke!

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:44.700
They're insane!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.100
Finish that rat!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:52.010
Big Brother!

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:53.310
Withdraw!

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:54.280
Okay!

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.670
And now you're here...

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:57.070
I shall seal the Head of the Conqueror!

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:21.870
Hermit Jofuku had two Moontears made.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:26.810
The large "Yin" sword was created to seal
the Head of the Conqueror.

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:36.050
The small "Yang" sword was created to break
the seal of the Vessel containing the Head.

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:43.790
However, when the "Yang" Moontear is
presented before the Head of the Conqueror...

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.320
WHAT?!

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:05.810
Why?

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:08.780
Akizuki-sama!

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:13.790
I see...

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.090
Now I understand.

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:23.360
O Pitiable Eternal Assassin...

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:31.840
Because you don't know your own destiny,
you let your destiny kill you.

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:55.530
Akizuki...

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:59.100
So that was the reason of
the negative aura you bear...

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:12.520
You put up a good fight!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:18.750
I'll never forget your bravery and iron spirit!

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:22.590
The ones who doubted
have already left this ship,

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:27.690
and those remaining, who share the same ideals,
have come together and become an army.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.330
He's managed to win the hearts of the soldiers.

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:38.240
The attacks made by the British Empire
must've pushed him forward.

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:46.380
This is what is inside the gut of Enomoto...

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:50.380
He's qualified to be my master...

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:57.190
We're off to the new battlefield... Ezo!
We're heading there together!

00:20:57.590 --> 00:21:00.590
Boiler crew! Get ready to set sail!

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:02.590
Ezo...

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>PATHETIC</i>
<i>DESTINY</i>

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.330
The hand is the sword of love

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.370
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
The dream is still an illusion

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Running on the path

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
The torn sword of love

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
At the end of it thousands of teardrops become one

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
And brighten tomorrow

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
This hand is the sword of love

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
It proves the beginning of all

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:48.130
EPISODE 19
BRIGHT
INVERTED
PENTAGRAM

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:37.690
It's been a long, long time!

00:23:37.690 --> 00:23:41.430
I see you having the attention all to yourself
without me. I'm so jealous!

00:23:41.590 --> 00:23:46.060
The two of you have the stage all to yourselves;
that makes me even more jealous!

00:23:46.300 --> 00:23:47.430
We're jealous!

00:23:47.430 --> 00:23:48.170
Leader!

00:23:48.130 --> 00:24:02.570
BRIGHT
INVERTED
PENTAGRAM

00:23:48.600 --> 00:23:49.470
Leader!

00:23:49.470 --> 00:23:51.240
You guys came!

00:23:51.440 --> 00:23:53.140
Yup, we're all here!

00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:54.770
We're all here!

00:23:54.770 --> 00:24:00.910
This is our first time in Hakodate!
We're the Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe!
